  "ruleText": "Fam 103.02 Composition of the Board. The board consists of 6 members who meet the eligibility requirements of RSA 328-C:4.\n\nSource. #5609, eff 4-6-93, EXPIRED: 4-6-99\n\nNew. #7716, INTERIM, eff 6-22-02, EXPIRED: 12-19-02\n\nNew. #7916, eff 7-11-03; ss by #9667, eff 4-2-10; ss by #14430, eff 11-22-25",
